# 所有服务的 Docker build context 都是仓库根目录，统一在这里排除不需要进镜像的内容，
# 避免宿主机的 node_modules/.venv 等被 COPY 进容器覆盖容器内重新安装的依赖。
.git/
.gitignore

**/.venv/
**/__pycache__/
**/*.pyc
**/.pytest_cache/
**/.mypy_cache/
**/.ruff_cache/
**/.coverage
**/.coverage.*
**/htmlcov/
**/*.egg-info/

**/node_modules/
frontend/dist/
frontend/.vite/

.env
.env.*
!.env.example

docs/
*.xlsx
*.png
.playwright-mcp/

# 部署凭据、证书、数据库备份不进入 Docker 构建上下文。
deploy/secrets/
deploy/backups/
deploy/compose/.p6.env
deploy/compose/.p6.runtime
frontend/e2e/.admin-password
frontend/test-results/
frontend/playwright-report/
